  <h2>3. How Affiliate Links Work</h2>
  <p>When you click an affiliate link, the merchant or the affiliate program may store a tracking cookie. If you later purchase or qualify, that mechanism can credit Dispatch Cove with a referral commission.</p>
  <h2>4. No Additional Cost to You</h2>
  <p>A commission does not raise the price you pay. The price is the merchant’s price. Commissions help pay for the site.</p>
  <h2>5. Editorial Independence</h2>
  <p>Opinions on this site are not for sale. We label affiliate links. We do not invent tests, statistics, or testimonials. A product can be mentioned together with a clear limitation, including a recommendation not to use it for the job the ad implies.</p>
  <h2>6. Product Mentions</h2>
  <p>We try to be accurate. We do not guarantee that a third-party service will fit your trucks, your brokers, or your cash-flow needs. We do not sell these services, take payment, fund invoices, or provide their customer support.</p>
  <h2>7. Third-Party Responsibility</h2>
